Getting started with SIGEL v1.4
-------------------------------

SIGEL was written in 2001 by project group PG 368 at the University of Dortmund:
https://sigel.sourceforge.net/seiten/einleitung_en.html

Versions 1.1 - 1.3 added MetaGP, based on the research of Jens Ziegler and Wolfgang Banzhaf.

This is an independent fork of the SIGEL project. It is not made, maintained
or endorsed by SIGEL's original authors.
Repository: https://github.com/jayMcBee/sigel-evolutionary-walking-robots
